@@ authorization_mode
- copy posting preferred a per-community token and needed an explicit user fallback.
+ copy, repost, photo upload, analytics and browser comments select the browser-local user token first.
+ a community token remains a fallback for comments only when no local user token exists.

@@ community_directory
- scheduled publication and analytics were populated only from vkr_group_tokens.
+ groups.get(filter=admin,editor,count=1000) populates vkr_user_groups.
+ scheduled publication, clips and analytics merge vkr_user_groups with optional vkr_group_tokens.

@@ delayed_comments
- a configured community token automatically sent the comment job to Render.
+ local_user is the default execution mode and keeps the job in Chrome.
+ community_24_7 is explicit and sends only the matching community token to Render.
+ target communities receive a configurable 30-second default stagger.

@@ popup
+ added a managed-community list with VK names/avatars and refresh action.
+ renamed community tokens to optional 24/7 credentials.
+ added local/server comment mode and per-community interval controls.

